{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/778869e538d6b113c6206c798f5cadf3.poster.avif?t=1771524095\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/778869e538d6b113c6206c798f5cadf3.webm?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/778869e538d6b113c6206c798f5cadf3.mp4?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Follow Wilorth\u2019s orders and set off on a revenge-fuelled journey. Be a useful puppet, carry out his will and extend your existence as long as you serve a purpose. Explore the elemental realms, conquer... or die trying. Craft your own strategy with unique builds, adapt your playstyle to the challenges ahead, and face the fate that was forced upon you. Fulfil your mission and free your captor.<br>Revenge is only the prelude to your oblivion!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/19a0dd72ea67befad9f61a23538d50a3.poster.avif?t=1771524095\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/19a0dd72ea67befad9f61a23538d50a3.webm?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Wilorth can\u2019t break himself free.</strong><br>In order to shatter his chains, souls must be sacrificed. Warriors from different worlds are being used like puppets: souls of knights, mages, or rogues, all bound to carry out vengeance-driven commands.<br><br><strong>Choose the soul that will shape the course of the game.</strong><br>Wilorth is watching, reminding you of every victory\u2026 and every defeat. Use the souls to reach your goals. How many will have to be sacrificed? <strong>Each soul brings a unique combat style, strengths, and weaknesses.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/6060cf6b26098fb18864bcbb7668998e.webp?t=1771524095\" width=616 height=53 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/406d29fd13c9b20f2a8fa93e162eb397.poster.avif?t=1771524095\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/406d29fd13c9b20f2a8fa93e162eb397.webm?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/406d29fd13c9b20f2a8fa93e162eb397.mp4?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The Guardians once deceived and imprisoned Wilorth,</strong> sacrificing everything to stop his corruption from devouring the elemental realms. But his prison won\u2019t hold forever. From the abyss' cracks, Wilorth spreads his shadow, controlling warriors from other worlds, turning them into vessels for his will. They are not allies but tools. Each soul he takes is another step towards revenge.<br><strong>Face the Guardians, destroy their domains, and claim the seeds they protect. Use those seeds to grow stronger.</strong><br>And remember: this isn\u2019t justice. It\u2019s revenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/6e793409d0ae54588c4e9c943e897d2f.webp?t=1771524095\" width=616 height=53 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/5f169114a2162746407577f33f30937b.poster.avif?t=1771524095\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/5f169114a2162746407577f33f30937b.webm?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/5f169114a2162746407577f33f30937b.mp4?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock perks that reshape your combat style, letting you tailor your strategy. <strong>The combination between characters, elements, and skills opens a world of possibilities:</strong> thousands of unique builds that will adapt to any situation.<br><strong>Due to permanent upgrades, you will keep some of your progress,</strong> even after defeat. The key to victory is versatility, adapt your playstyle, conquer the realms, and become the ultimate weapon of vengeance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/ecb2aa173cd755af7fac9d719ed14997.webp?t=1771524095\" width=616 height=53 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/f1c3f4c62e67b8c2484085bd781c7572.poster.avif?t=1771524095\" width=616 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/f1c3f4c62e67b8c2484085bd781c7572.webm?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/f1c3f4c62e67b8c2484085bd781c7572.mp4?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Each realm is tied to an element with its own strengths and weaknesses.</strong><br><br>Wilorth grants you the power of the Abyss to begin your conquest of the realms of Water, Fire, Nature, Light, and Darkness. <strong>Chose a seed of power prior to entering a realm for maximum power.</strong> Water douses Fire, Fire burns Nature, and Nature absorbs Water. Light will quench the terrible curse of darkness, while Dark will harken the night and silence the light.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/93f2fb21fd995b1a579e35805cb5772d.avif?t=1771524095\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br><strong><i>When Wilorth calls, souls ought to listen</i></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/5bd1e98a2bfb90929349b1f15cebe910.poster.avif?t=1771524095\" width=590 height=325 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/extras/5bd1e98a2bfb90929349b1f15cebe910.webm?t=1771524095\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420090?t=1771524095","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/3e0798717ca26c5046b592ac31dfabb124529ede/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771524095","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/45ba6347c78f3ff7cb0d70887acf5b257c9ac84d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771524095","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420090/45ba6347c78f3ff7cb0d70887acf5b257c9ac84d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771524095","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2968930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video 